  "question": {
    "text": "In an experiment on a circuit as shown in the figure, the voltmeter shows \\(8 \\mathrm{~V}\\) reading. The resistance of the voltmeter is,\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/9yiW5b3EPP3ydpLVc32AhSEIgQwLm_8iTuEB6DAQvxU.original.fullsize.png\"><br>",
    "image": null
