  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Hint: Voltage across \\(20 \\Omega=2 \\mathrm{~V}\\)\nMain current \\(=\\frac{2}{20}=0.1 \\mathrm{~A}\\)\nCurrent through \\(160 \\Omega=\\frac{8}{160}=\\frac{1}{20}=0.05 \\mathrm{~A}\\)\nAlso, \\(8 \\mathrm{~V}=0.05 \\times \\mathrm{R}\\)\n\\(R=\\frac{8}{0.05}=160 \\Omega\\)",
    "image": null
